## 💻 Software Pipeline & Tools

| Tool | Role in Ground Station Pipeline |
| :--- | :--- |
| **GNU Radio** | Block-based RF signal processing, custom filtering, demodulation, and signal-flow experimentation. |
| **SDR Console** | Real-time frequency tuning, spectrum/waterfall observation, and audio monitoring. |
| **GPredict & STK** | Satellite pass prediction, orbit visualization, and tracking to account for Doppler shift. |
| **SatDump / WXtoImg** | Signal demodulation, framing, and offline decoding of satellite data. |

